    <detaileddescription>
<para>Health check system for monitoring shard and cluster health.</para>
<para>Performs periodic health checks on shards including:<itemizedlist>
<listitem><para>Certificate validity and expiration</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>Storage capacity</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>Network connectivity</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>Response time</para>
</listitem></itemizedlist>
</para>
<para>Aggregates shard health into cluster-wide status. </para>
